  #line-at(70.824pt, 81.98pt, "This separation of timescales introduces a time-dependent electrostatic screening mechanism ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 102.74pt, "that strongly modifies the frequency-dependent electrical response of the device, containing ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 123.38pt, "direct information of the ionic transport properties. Establishing a quantitative relationship ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 144.14pt, "between the frequency-dependent behavior of the associated capacitance and ionic transport ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 164.78pt, "forms the basis of the present analytical framework. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 185.54pt, "An analytical relationship between the total device capacitance and the frequency can be ")
