#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(511.68pt, 788.64pt, "19 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.824pt, 81.98pt, "coexistence of ionic and transport-layer relaxation processes and accurately reproducing the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 102.74pt, "resulting frequency-dependent capacitance response. The excellent agreement between ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 123.38pt, "analytical predictions and numerical simulations demonstrates the robustness and general ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 144.14pt, "applicability of the model. Furthermore, we established a direct connection between the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 164.78pt, "frequency-dependent capacitance response and scan-rate-dependent current–voltage hysteresis. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 185.54pt, "The same ionic relaxation time extracted from ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(304.99pt, 185.54pt, "C–f")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(322.51pt, 185.54pt, " measurements was shown to predict the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 206.18pt, "characteristic scan-rate window at which hysteresis reaches its maximum. Experimental ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 226.97pt, "temperature-dependent measurements confirmed this relationship, providing strong evidence ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 247.61pt, "that ionic dielectric relaxation is the common physical origin underlying both the frequency-")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 268.37pt, "dependent capacitance response and hysteresis dynamics. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 289.01pt, "Overall, this work provides a unified description of ion-induced dynamic phenomena in ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 309.77pt, "perovskite solar cells by linking ionic dielectric relaxation, the frequency-dependent ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 330.41pt, "capacitance response, and hysteresis dynamics within a single analytical framework. The ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 351.17pt, "proposed model offers a simple and practical approach for extracting ion mobility from routine ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 371.81pt, "capacitance–frequency measurements and provides valuable insight into the role of ion ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 392.59pt, "migration in device operation and stability. More broadly, the framework establishes ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 413.23pt, "capacitance spectroscopy as a powerful tool for investigating ionic transport and predicting ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 433.99pt, "dynamic device behavior in perovskite solar cells and related mixed ionic–electronic ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 454.63pt, "conductors. ")
